{"version":1,"key":"card:250","content":{"id":250,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"76b8136d-224f-486c-9590-cdd9f1fb67ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有的时候代码中需要共享一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，ES6 提供了一个全局的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 管理机构，我们可以在任何时候访问它。我们是通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol.for"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法来访问这个全局机构的，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol.for"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 接收一个字符串参数，根据这个字符串参数在全局机构中查找对应的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果找到了就返回，如果没有找到，则在全局机构中新建一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 并返回。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"45712d33-fd22-4494-a5fd-7cc389b4b384","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"cc6ce9db-32f1-4d7b-943f-013cb243e949","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 此时根据字符串 \"id\" 查不到 Symbol\n// 会新建一个 Symbol 并返回\nlet id = Symbol.for(\"id\");\nconsole.log(typeof id);    // symbol\n\n// 此时可根据 \"id\" 查找到 Symbol，返回\n// 返回的 Symbol 与上次根据 \"id\" 创建的 Symbol 是同一个 Symbol\nlet id2 = Symbol.for(\"id\");\nconsole.log(id2 == id);    // true","collabId":"85f7142e-44f1-470e-aead-9f28e36ab936","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7d0d7241-0d46-4087-8da9-01b23f5ec1c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol.for"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法相对应的是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol.keyfor"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它是根据接收的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来获得在全局机构中对应的字符串，如果全局机构中没有该 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，则返回 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"undefined"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"8375e9de-5ef0-41bc-bc60-a93eb53467ba","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"cf791ca3-1b85-46f0-b045-e4708e01866e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let uid = Symbol.for(\"uid\");\nconsole.log(Symbol.keyFor(uid));  // \"uid\"\n\nlet uid2 = Symbol.for(\"uid\");\nconsole.log(Symbol.keyFor(uid2)); // \"uid\"\n\n// 不是通过 Symbol.for 从全局获得的 Symbol\nlet uid3 = Symbol(\"uid\");\nconsole.log(Symbol.keyFor(uid3)); // undefined","collabId":"ab8791ba-f236-4cac-a411-bdd6a2a45aa3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"],"createTime":1690986011561,"updateTime":1757772168616,"linkedCards":[{"id":249,"target":{"key":"card:249","type":"card","id":249},"summary":"Symbol 是 ES6 引入的一种新的原始类型，类型的值唯一的，每个被创建出来的 Symbol 变量都是不同的，这是 Symbol 这种数据类型最大的特点，常常用于作为对象的属性，以防止被不正确篡改。 Symbol 不能通过字面量来进行创...","tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1757772168616}}